Package: gitleaks
Version: 8.30.1-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Vaizer0
Depends: git, golang
Section: security
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Vaizer0/zero-termux
Description: Detect hard-coded secrets and sensitive data in Git repositories
 Gitleaks is a SAST tool for detecting and preventing hardcoded secrets
 like passwords, API keys, and tokens in Git repositories.
